<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45840" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφορμ-ίζω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅρμος</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bring</i> a ship <i>to
				her moorings, bring to shore</i>, in 
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφὶ ταύτην θῖνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					7.636
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Crin.
			</span></i>):—
				Med.
			 and 
				Pass.
			, <i>come to anchor</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς [λιμένα]</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					4.8
				</span></i>
			:—in 
				Med.
			 also, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφορμέω, -ορμιούμενος τοῖς
					πολεμίοις</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>BC</u>
				5.108
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr. in 
				Act.
			, <i>seek refuge in</i>, [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔλαφοι] ποταμοῖσιν ἐφώρμισαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					9.244
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Apollonid.
			</span></i>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				254
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Phil.
			</span></i>).</div>
